@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<!-- Hero -->
<section style="background:#1a1a1a;padding:72px 40px 56px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
    <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0,rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px,transparent 1px,transparent 60px),repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 0,rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px,transparent 1px,transparent 60px);pointer-events:none;"></div>
    <p style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#aaa;margin-bottom:16px;">About the platform</p>
    <h1 style="font-size:40px;font-weight:400;color:#fff;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.2;">About <span style="color:#c8a96e;">Coza Store</span></h1>
    <div style="width:48px;height:2px;background:#c8a96e;margin:0 auto 18px;"></div>
    <p style="font-size:14px;color:#999;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.7;">A modern fashion e-commerce platform built from the ground up — designed to be fast, elegant, and effortless to use.</p>
</section>

<!-- Story -->
<div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:70px 40px;">
    <p style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c8a96e;margin-bottom:14px;">Our story</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:28px;font-weight:400;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:18px;line-height:1.3;">Built as a project,<br />designed as a product</h2>
    <p style="font-size:14px;color:#666;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:16px;">Coza Store is a full-featured fashion e-commerce web application developed by a team of six students as part of their academic journey. What started as a project requirement quickly evolved into a fully realized platform — one that takes design, usability, and technical quality seriously.</p>
    <p style="font-size:14px;color:#666;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:16px;">The platform covers the complete shopping lifecycle: browsing curated collections, filtering by category and price, viewing detailed product pages, managing a cart, and completing a checkout. Every screen was thought through with real users in mind.</p>
    <div style="border-left:3px solid #c8a96e;padding:14px 20px;margin:28px 0;background:#f8f7f4;">
        <p style="font-size:17px;font-weight:400;color:#1a1a1a;font-style:italic;line-height:1.6;">"We didn't want to build something that just worked — we wanted to build something people would actually enjoy using."</p>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size:14px;color:#666;line-height:1.85;margin-bottom:16px;">The design draws from modern fashion retail aesthetics — a dark editorial hero, clean product grids, and a warm gold accent that ties the brand together. The codebase is built on ASP.NET Core MVC, following clean architecture principles with a focus on maintainability and scalability.</p>
</div>

